[ar:YOUA]
[ti:THE TENTH SEASON]
[al:The Fifth Season]
[00:01.17]If I move closer
[00:19.10]Like an old photograph
[00:20.72]Fading into view
[00:22.50]Same familiar smile
[00:23.98]The light I thought I knew
[00:26.13]Traces of the silence
[00:27.67]Lingering in your eyes
[00:29.76]Took the longest road
[00:31.53]Still you feel like home
[00:33.52]Now a frozen heart
[00:35.37]Starts to beat again
[00:37.25]Like a gentle tide
[00:40.46]Drifting back to you
[00:44.95]If I move closer
[00:46.60]Will you drift away?
[00:48.49]If I call your name
[00:50.20]Would you choose to stay?
[00:52.17]Ten seasons gone
[00:53.89]Still I turn your way
[00:55.83]One step closer
[00:59.37]Don’t fade away
[01:04.62]Every whispered word
[01:06.47]Every quiet laugh
[01:08.45]Echoes in my mind
[01:10.13]Long after goodbye
[01:12.43]Thought I knew you well
[01:14.03]Now you feel so new
[01:15.96]Through the passing years
[01:17.64]I come back to you
[01:19.77]Maybe you feel it too
[01:21.45]Maybe you’re afraid
[01:23.44]We don’t have to rush
[01:28.62]Let’s just take it slow
[01:33.14]If I move closer
[01:34.70]Will you drift away?
[01:36.50]If I take your hand
[01:38.31]Would you choose to stay?
[01:40.37]Ten seasons gone
[01:41.98]Still I turn your way
[01:43.66]Just one more step
[01:45.59]Could bring you back my way
[02:02.66]We lost all those years
[02:06.21]Yet something remains
[02:09.76]No need to name it now
[02:12.77]Just stay here again
[02:17.32]If I move closer
[02:20.75]Don’t you drift away
[02:24.45]If I call your name
[02:27.75]Let the moment stay
[02:32.17]Ten seasons gone
[02:35.56]Still I turn your way
[02:39.24]One step closer
[02:42.06]This time, choose to stay
[02:46.63]Ten seasons passed
[02:50.30]Brought me back to you
[02:53.97]After all this time
[02:57.45]Still I’m drawn to you
